 "text": "Recorder | Lawrence County, IN\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nGovernment\nJustice\nCommunity\nResources\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nRecorder\nRecorder\nThis office contains all of Lawrence County's deed and mortgage records since its formation. We also have other documents recorded down through the years. We are required by law to record any document as long as it meets the standards set forth by Indiana Code. All records, with one exception - military discharges - may be viewed and printed from our files. There is a one dollar per page charge.\nGeneral Office Information:\nThe Lawrence County Recorder's Office accepts all forms of payment.\nAll transactions must be paid in full at time of service.\nWe can only look up records by name. There are other resources in the Courthouse to help you in your search.\nOur ability to search is limited. We can steer you to qualified, insured businesses that can further help your search.\nYou can search at the Doxpop website for records December 1, 1994 to the present.\nE-File\nEffective August 22, 2023 - All Transferable Documents Are Now Being Accepted Through E-file. The Following Companies Are Approved As Certified eRecording Service Providers (ERSP):\nCSC 855-200-1150\nePN 888-325-3365\nINDECOMM 704-412-3179\nSIMPLIFILE 800-460-5657\nAny Questions pertaining to e-files, please call 812-275-4139 or email Jessica Allen\nContact Us\nJessica Allen\nRecorder\nEmail Jessica Allen\nPhone: 812-275-4139\nShelbi Anderson\nFirst Deputy\nAleta Taylor\nSecond Deputy\nRecorder\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n916 15th Street\nRoom 21\nBedford , IN 47421\n916 15th Street Room 21 Bedford IN 47421\nDirections\nPhone: 812-275-4139\nHours\n8 am to 4 pm (last recording time is 3:30 pm)\nDirectory\nAssessor\nAuditor\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office\nHealth Department\nEnvironmental Health\nHealth Education Resources\nImmunization Information\nPublic Health Nursing\nVital Records\nFood Protection and Tattoo/Body Piercing\nSwimming Pools: Public and Semi-Public\nHighway Department\nLawrence County Map\nRecorder\nSoil & Water Conservation\nSolid Waste Management\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service\nAgendas & Minutes\nEmployment\nPhone Directory\n-->\nLawrence County Courthouse\n916 15 th Street\nBedford, IN 47421\nBusiness Hours 8am to 4pm, Monday through Friday. Closed on holidays.\nEmployment\nLimestone Country\nBedford Chamber of Commerce\nMitchell Chamber of Commerce\nEconomic Growth Council\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHome\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nSite Map\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
